Package: gendertext
Title: Detect and Suggest Alternatives for Gendered Language
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("S M Mashrur", "Arafin Ayon", email = "mashrur399@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3659-2891"))
Description: Reads documents (txt, pdf, docx, etc.), detects gendered language using a built-in dictionary, 
    reports the share of gendered vs gender-neutral terms, and suggests gender-neutral alternatives.
